OL,3,GNEWSAMurder victim's contact with
OL,4,Apolice to be examined
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review into the murder of a
OL,7,F38-year-old mother-of-three who had
OL,8,Fcomplained about her on-off partner's
OL,9,Fabusive and controlling behaviour has
OL,10,Fraised concerns about the performance
OL,11,Fof police and professionals.
OL,13,FMatthew Waddell was jailed for a
OL,14,Fminimum of 32 years in 2023, for
OL,15,Fkilling Sarah Albone and putting her
OL,16,Fbody in a wheelie bin at her home in
OL,17,FBiggleswade, Bedfordshire.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
